<title>USA: Schuff Steel IPO size reduced.</title>
<headline>Schuff Steel IPO size reduced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schuff Steel Inc's initial public offering size has been reduced to an expected 2.0 million shares from 2.2 million shares, said underwriter Principal Financial Securities Inc.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to price on July 1 between $9 and $11 per share.</p>
<p>Schuff based in Phoenix, Ariz., is a steel fabrication and erection company.</p>
</text>
